    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: Oh, how I have wondered how my life would be if I could
        see colors like everyone else... Excuse me, darling.
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: 8d0cae8d-9955-47cf-b917-3245bf1fe72c
    Position: {x: 1638, y: -14}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: 'You know? Sometimes my disability makes it harder for
        me to connect with other people. '
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: 387c6883-214b-4792-9fb7-a702668501be
    Position: {x: 1401, y: -14}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: Makes sense why people are so upset today then. I am sure
        you will find the culprit soon enough, darling.
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: c8dc9352-e132-4608-b9d6-252744a60cb3
    Position: {x: 1185, y: -14}
